  "published": "2026-02-18T13:54:37.643Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.1 — Full API v2 compatibility\n\nNew endpoints:\n- Contacts: Create, Get (by ID/email), List, Update (global unsubscribe), Delete\n- Events: List (with type filter, pagination), Get by ID\n- Webhooks: Full CRUD with event subscriptions\n\nUpdated endpoints:\n- Emails: RetryEmailAsync replaces ResendEmailAsync, Tracking object replaces TrackOpens/TrackClicks, Meta/Headers added, CancelEmailAsync returns structured response\n- Domains: PATCH for updates, new verification status fields (SPF, DKIM, MX, DMARC), removed FromEmail\n- Templates: Required Alias, new fields (From, ReplyTo, Editor), new pagination with filters, {data, message} response wrapper\n- Suppressions: KeepUntil for temporary suppressions, lookup by email, new type values\n- Subscribers: Subscribed bool replaces Status, subscribed list filter, linked ContactId/AudienceId\n- Verification: Rich response with Checks, Address, MxRecords, Score, Risk, Mode\n- API Keys: LastUsedAt field\n\nBreaking changes:\n- CancelEmailAsync returns CancelEmailResponse instead of bool\n- ListTemplatesAsync accepts ListTemplatesRequest instead of (int page, int limit)\n- ListSubscribersAsync adds optional subscribed filter parameter\n- SendEmailRequest: removed TrackOpens, TrackClicks, Metadata\n- EmailVerificationResponse: removed old fields, replaced with Score/Risk/Checks\n- SubscriberResponse: removed Status, replaced with Subscribed bool\n- CreateDomainRequest: removed FromEmail\n- TemplateResponse: removed Version/Published, replaced with PublishedAt/Versions",
  "repository": "",
